('Clawdia', 1, 1, 1, 2, 3.50, 'Female',
 'Cute cat with a sharp personality.',
 'Clawdia is a mischievous Domestic Short Hair who enjoys knocking cups off tables and demanding attention on her own schedule. She prowls the house like a tiny queen, darting under couches and leaping onto shelves. Despite her antics, she loves curling up on laps at the end of the day, purring loudly as if rewarding her humans for enduring her playful chaos.',
 'Available', 1, N''),

-- Dog
('Bark Twain', 2, 2, 2, 4, 18.20, 'Male',
 'A storyteller with a loud bark.',
 'Bark Twain is a lovable Labrador with endless energy, always ready for a walk or a cuddle after spinning his tales. He can often be found racing through the yard, playfully chasing sticks, and nudging anyone nearby to join in the fun. After an active morning of adventures, he settles down with a dramatic yawn, leaning against his favorite human to share stories only he knows, leaving everyone laughing and shaking their heads in admiration.',
 'Adopted', 2, N''),

-- Fish
('Gillbert', 3, 5, 3, 1, 0.15, 'Unknown',
 'A tiny goldfish with a big personality.',
 'Gillbert swims in circles with style, making bubbles that seem like applause for himself. He’s always alert to new movements outside his tank, greeting visitors with tiny flips and swishes. Whether darting through his aquatic plants or inspecting every corner of his watery domain, he exudes confidence far beyond his small size, making him the undisputed star of the fishbowl.',
 'Available', 3, N''),

-- Owl
('Hootie', 4, 6, 4, 3, 1.10, 'Male',
 'Sleeps by day, wisdom by night.',
 'Hootie is a calm barn owl who prefers moonlight and silence, but he’ll turn heads with his majestic stare. He spends the day perched quietly, blending into the barn’s wooden beams, and comes alive as dusk falls. With silent wings and piercing eyes, he surveys his surroundings with quiet authority, embodying the wisdom of the night and leaving observers in awe of his serene presence.',
 'Adopted', 4, N''),

-- Pigeon
('Sir Coos-a-Lot', 5, 7, 2, 2, 0.40, 'Male',
 'Always cooing, always charming.',
 'Sir Coos-a-Lot struts around like royalty in the park, cooing his song for all to hear. He takes pride in his perfectly preened feathers, pausing to puff out his chest and display his elegance to anyone who passes by. Curious and friendly, he’s always ready to investigate new sights or share a soft coo with a fellow pigeon, making him the undisputed socialite of the urban aviary.',
 'Available', 5, N''),

-- Rabbit
('Hoprah Winfrey', 6, 8, 1, 1, 2.00, 'Female',
 'A bunny who loves an audience.',
 'Hoprah Winfrey is a talkative rabbit in her own way—thumping the ground and twitching her nose whenever it’s showtime. She enjoys entertaining her humans, hopping around with playful enthusiasm and performing daring leaps across her enclosure. Beyond her theatrical flair, she’s also affectionate, curling up for snuggles once the performance ends, showing that her heart is as big as her personality.',
 'Available', 6, N''),

-- Turtle
('Shellvis Presley', 7, 9, 5, 5, 3.70, 'Male',
 'Slow moves, rock ’n’ roll soul.',
 'Shellvis Presley may be slow, but he’s got rhythm. He loves basking under the light and rocking side-to-side, moving in a way that feels like a private concert. His calm demeanor makes him the perfect companion for quiet moments, but he still has bursts of curiosity, stretching his neck to inspect his surroundings or gently nudging his favorite shell decorations. Each slow step is a little performance in itself.',
